Please note that the actual data format of the UV index and Visible ALS data may vary depending on the specific Si1145 sensor model and the way it is configured. The code above assumes that the data is in big-endian format (most significant byte first). If the data is in little-endian format (least significant byte first), you will need to swap the bytes in the uv_index and als_visible variables.

